  "name": "Consistency of Scale-Dependent Gravitational Response in EFC: Numerical Regime Transition Test",
  "description": "First numerical consistency test showing the EFC regime transition is smooth: μ < 1 (linear cosmological) and μ > 1 (non-linear galactic) are two limits of the same action connected through R ∝ k⁻⁴ stiffness response.",
